All 11 required H2 headings present in order, frontmatter counts match the document, and the draft SHA is unchanged. Sibling reviews appeared in the directory during my pass; I did not open any of them.

**Saved artifact:** `docs/content-analysis/perspective-reviews/Tyla/2026-08-15_020003/enneagram.md`

**Verdict:** `revise` — trust strained, value high, delight clear_hit. **2 blockers, 8 concerns.**

**Strongest hit (ENN-H1)** — the diagnosis paragraph locates the *object* of the fear rather than restating the fear: "Sevens are organized against confinement. Most of them meet it in ordinary shapes: a job with no exits, a heavy relationship, a Tuesday with nothing on it. Tyla grew up in the one country on earth that wrote down what everybody was and enforced the writing, so her version of the cage is a category." It holds the type constant and lets the environment specify the shape — person-first, jargon-free, non-transplantable. It must survive revision intact.

**Highest-priority concern — actually the lead blocker (ENN-R1):** both of the draft's Type 7-vs-Type 3 discriminators fail, while the piece presents the differential as settled.

- "A Three would never call pop stardom a jail. For a Three, that is the arrival" is contradicted by mainstream theory *and* by 9takes' own Type 3 pillar page, which is titled **"When Success Becomes Your Prison"** and closes "Achievements were never the price of admission. They were the prison."
- The other tiebreaker (the March 2024 cancellation) rests on the unverifiable premise that continuing to perform was available — the injury is undisclosed and the packet forbids speculating about it.
- These compound: the keystone evidence for the type call is the word "jail," which under the first point is at least as available to the alternative type.

The repair needs no new research — the discriminating evidence is already in the packet: she refused label-supplied pop material at the commercial peak ("I didn't get signed to do this," Variety) and screens material by "I only work on things that make me feel something the first time I hear it." That is interest-calibration over audience-calibration, which is the real 3/7 fork and doesn't depend on the injury.

Second blocker (ENN-R2): the 7w8 wing call and the intro's "it has nothing to do with media training" both rest on the Breakfast Club silence, which the record shows was staff-managed — her publicist interjected and management pre-declared the topic.

One thing worth flagging beyond my lane: the type call itself is defensible, and the draft's hedges ("medium-high"), its labeled guess, and its refusal to explain away the decade-of-continuity anomaly are unusually honest work. My finding is that the differential is unsupported as written, not that Type 7 is wrong.
